  "description": "4 Bedroom House to Let – Riverside Drive, The Quay, Ballina, Co. Mayo\n\nBeautifully refurbished 4-bedroom semi‑detached home in the highly sought‑after Quay area of Ballina. Presented to an excellent standard throughout, this property offers comfort, style, and convenience in a quiet cul‑de‑sac setting.\n\nGround Floor\nBright, spacious living room with solid fuel stove and oil‑fired central heating\n\nAttractive outlook over the front garden and communal green area\n\nModern open‑plan kitchen/dining area with fitted units and integrated appliances\n\nPatio doors leading to a fully enclosed private rear garden laid to lawn\n\nDownstairs WC\n\nFirst Floor\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\n\nTwo further good‑sized bedrooms\n\nOne single bedroom / ideal home office\n\nModern family bathroom with bath and overhead shower\n\nHot press / linen storage\n\nSiro fiber broadband connected\n\nFeatures & Amenities\nOil‑fired central heating with recently fitted boiler\n\nDouble‑glazed windows throughout\n\nOff‑street parking to front\n\nFully enclosed rear garden – ideal for children\n\nFiber broadband available\n\nQuiet cul‑de‑sac location with excellent access to Ballina town center, Quay village, walkways, parks, schools, shops, and transport links\n\nAdditional Information\n\nNon‑smokers preferred\n\nRTB tenancy agreement provided\n\nReferences required\n\nDue to high demand, email enquiries only.\nPlease include a short introduction about yourself, including who will be living in the property, any other relevant information you feel would be helpful. and we will respond as soon as possible.\n",
